(I, Jane Smith, Business Executive, of Suite 1800 - 1075 West Georgia Street, Vancouver, BC, SWEAR THAT:) Tj
T*
(1. I am the President and Chief Executive Officer of the Plaintiff, Acme Enterprises Ltd. \('Acme'\), and as such) Tj
T*
(   I have personal knowledge of the matters hereinafter deposed to, except where stated on information and belief.) Tj
T*
(2. Acme is an investment and real estate development company incorporated pursuant to the laws of British Columbia.) Tj
T*
(3. On January 15, 2025, Acme entered into a formal Joint Venture Agreement with the Defendant, Pacific Developments) Tj
T*
(   Corp. \('Pacific'\), to acquire and construct a 28-storey residential tower at 1200 Burrard Street, Vancouver, BC.) Tj
T*
(   Attached hereto and marked as Exhibit 'A' is a true copy of the Joint Venture Development Agreement.) Tj
T*
(4. Pursuant to Section 4.2 of the Agreement, Pacific was designated Managing Partner, and was expressly required to) Tj
T*
(   maintain separate project accounts and provide monthly general ledger extracts and bank statements to Acme.) Tj
T*
(5. On May 10, 2026, I received an urgent cash-call request from the Defendant John Doe claiming cost escalations had) Tj
T*
(   exhausted the contingency budget and requesting an immediate capital contribution of $1,500,000 from Acme.) Tj
ET
endstream
