(6. On May 12, 2026, in reliance upon the representations made by Mr. Doe, Acme transferred $1,500,000 into the account.) Tj
T*
(7. Following the transfer, I made repeated requests to Mr. Doe for wire transfer confirmations and bank statements.) Tj
T*
(   No accounting or bank verification was provided.) Tj
T*
(8. On August 12, 2026, Pacific delivered its List of Documents, which omitted all raw bank statements for Account 4410-***.) Tj
T*
(9. On September 14, 2026, litigation counsel sent a formal demand letter. Attached hereto as Exhibit 'B' is a copy.) Tj
T*
(10. By reply letter dated September 28, 2026, Defendants' counsel refused to produce the documents.) Tj
T*
(11. Without unredacted access to the actual bank statements, Acme is unable to determine whether its $1,500,000 was) Tj
T*
(    expended on the project or diverted to Pacific's unrelated ventures.) Tj
T*
() Tj
