(THIS JOINT VENTURE DEVELOPMENT AGREEMENT dated for reference the 15th day of January, 2025.) Tj
T*
(BETWEEN:  ACME ENTERPRISES LTD. \('Investor Partner'\)  AND:  PACIFIC DEVELOPMENTS CORP. \('Managing Partner'\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(WHEREAS the parties have agreed to form a joint venture to develop the lands at 1200 Burrard Street, Vancouver, BC;) Tj
T*
(NOW THEREFORE in consideration of the mutual covenants herein contained, the parties agree as follows:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(ARTICLE 4 - MANAGEMENT, ACCOUNTS, AND AUDIT RIGHTS) Tj
T*
(4.1 Managing Partner Appointment: Pacific is appointed Managing Partner with operational carriage of construction.) Tj
T*
(4.2 Books, Records, and Dedicated Accounts:) Tj
T*
(    \(a\) The Managing Partner shall maintain full, true, and unredacted books of account in accordance with Canadian ASPE.) Tj
T*
(    \(b\) All project funds, including contingency capital, shall be held in dedicated Canadian Commercial Bank Account) Tj
T*
(        No. 4410-*** \(the 'Project Account'\) and shall not be commingled with any other project or corporate funds.) Tj
T*
(    \(c\) The Investor Partner shall have the absolute right upon three \(3\) business days' written notice to inspect,) Tj
T*
(        audit, and take copies of all bank statements, general ledgers, draw certificates, and trade invoices.) Tj
ET
